smb: add common SMB2 compression transform helpers

jira KERNEL-1962
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-5.14.0-741.27.1.el9_9
commit-author Namjae Jeon <linkinjeon@kernel.org>
commit 6234f50105fbb0fffe878b6b493325d67822e43b
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-5.14.0-741.27.1.el9_9/6234f501.failed

Implement common validation, compression and decompression for SMB2
compression transforms.

Support unchained LZ77 and chained NONE, LZ77 and Pattern_V1 payloads.

	Signed-off-by: Namjae Jeon <linkinjeon@kernel.org>
	Signed-off-by: Steve French <stfrench@microsoft.com>
(cherry picked from commit 6234f50105fbb0fffe878b6b493325d67822e43b)
	Signed-off-by: Jonathan Maple <jmaple@ciq.com>

